The anonymizeData function is called for every message key and value when=
 HIPAA mode is enabled, and it compiles and executes seven different rege=
x patterns on each string. Since regex compilation is expensive, these pa=
tterns should be pre-compiled as package-level variables (using regexp.Mu=
stCompile at init time) rather than being compiled on every function call=
. This will significantly improve performance when processing large numbe=
rs of sampled messages.

