The ClientAuth field is set incorrectly. This field should be set on the =
server side, not the client side. For mutual TLS on the client, the clien=
t only needs to provide its certificate in the Certificates field, which =
is already done above. Setting ClientAuth to RequireAndVerifyClientCert o=
n the client has no effect and shows a misunderstanding of TLS configurat=
ion.
